{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1292885-a-vigil-roadtrip","id":1292885,"title":"A Vigil Roadtrip","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-28T17:15:27-08:00","id":1292885,"title":"A Vigil Roadtrip","content":"From what I have noticed, most of the COD have settings centered around a single city. Has there ever been a type of cross country campaign for HtV? Defend Mankind, See New Places, Purge the Darkness, Spend over Two Dots in Resources (Gas Money, lol)! After all isn't Life a Journey? (said the Promethean.) Anyways, what would a traveling Hunter cell look like? What kind of people would it attract? Would it quickly become a Cancer cell? The variables and possibilities are endless, my friends.<br /> <br /> I would suggest a new Compact based around traveling around these States to hunt specific prey. Heh, I can't seem to think of any specific Metanaturals for them to Hunt. Any suggestions are welcome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7106-extant-reality","name":"Extant Reality","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-28T17:33:08-08:00","id":1292888,"title":"","content":"So a Knight of Saint George, an Ascending One, and a Lucifuge all hop in a car.<br /> <br /> Some of the Conspiracies and Compacts actually have travel baked into their organizational structure, like the above three.<br /> <br /> (Also Sagaris Guardians are assumed to be travelling adventurers)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-05T14:08:06-08:00","id":1294167,"title":"","content":"If it's a road trip they're probably hunting Prometheans. A compact of bikers would work, and I do remember that there's a quasi-compact of truckers mentioned in one of the earlier sourcebooks hunting the interstates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-06T05:10:31-08:00","id":1294370,"title":"","content":"Any group above Individual Cell could be a travelling group, heading to hotspots reported by their peers and acting as trouble-shooters.<br /> <br /> This isn't ideal for certain Professions or just starting Hinters, however, so keep that in mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avata